---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout
  title="Contact ClearCalc Tools"
  description="Email zayed70010@gmail.com about a calculator error, a new calculator idea, or a partnership. ClearCalc has no contact form and no account."
>
  <section class="legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Contact ClearCalc</h1>
    <p>Email is the way to reach me. Write to <a href="mailto:zayed70010@gmail.com">zayed70010@gmail.com</a>. I read messages sent to that address. There is no contact form on this site, and there is no account to sign in to.</p>
    <h2>A calculator error</h2>
    <p>Tell me the name of the calculator, the values you typed, the result you saw, and the result you expected. If a tax page is involved, include the jurisdiction and the tax year on the page. Those details are enough to check the formula. A screenshot is useful, but the numbers matter more.</p>
    <h2>A calculator suggestion</h2>
    <p>Describe the question you want answered, and say which country it is for. Ideas for tax, duty, or paycheck tools are most useful when they name the jurisdiction and the year the rates should follow.</p>
    <h2>Partnerships</h2>
    <p>If you are writing about a partnership or another business note, say who you are and what you have in mind. Use the same email address. I do not take those notes through a form.</p>
    <p>Privacy questions about the site can use that address as well. The <a href={`${base}privacy-policy/`}>privacy policy</a> explains what the pages do and do not collect.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
